"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_MusicSheet_ThePower</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_MusicSheet_ThePower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_JewelryShop_MusicSheet_ThePower\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">53b32e10-99fd-49d7-8214-549a9976ba4b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:53b32e10-99fd-49d7-8214-549a9976ba4b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:53b32e10-99fd-49d7-8214-549a9976ba4b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Glitter_Gala#Basement\" title=\"The Glitter Gala\">The Glitter Gala Basement</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2385&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-453</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Scale\" title=\"Chromatic Scale\">Chromatic Scale</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-170&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-60</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><i>The Power</i>\n</p><p><br>\nRocky though the road might be, blinding be the sun,\n</p><p>Raise your swords and grab your wands - the battle will be won.\n</p><p>Champions, cry into the wind!\n</p><p>Warriors, stomp upon the ground!\n</p><p>You are the victors true. You are The Power!\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>These lyrics do not fit the rhythm of the actual song <a href=\"/wiki/Perform_%27The_Power%27\" title=\"Perform 'The Power'\">'The Power'</a> that can be played using the Perform action. That song does have a lyrical version, with a totally different set of lyrics from these, which can be heard during the game's closing credits and on the official soundtrack album.</li>\n<li>See also:</li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Music_and_Lyrics:_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Music and Lyrics: 'Bard Dance'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Music_and_Lyrics:_%27Bard_Dance%27\" title=\"Music and Lyrics: 'Bard Dance'\">Music and Lyrics: 'Bard Dance'</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Music_and_Lyrics:_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Music and Lyrics: 'Old Time Battles'\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Music_and_Lyrics:_%27Old_Time_Battles%27\" title=\"Music and Lyrics: 'Old Time Battles'\">Music and Lyrics: 'Old Time Battles'</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715063438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2053/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31610/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9237/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 980504/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   54.165      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   54.165      1 -total\n 37.23%   20.167     27 Template:Trim\n 37.22%   20.159      6 Template:Icon_text\n 25.36%   13.739      2 Template:RarityItem\n 23.82%   12.903      2 Template:Item_icon\n 18.20%    9.860    